From: Vinayak <“vinayak.kulkarni@ametek.com”>
Date: Tue, 14 Oct 2025 05:46:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Adds support of Arasan SD3.0 for ZynqMP
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Signed-off-by: Vinayak <“vinayak.kulkarni@ametek.com”>
